  "body_html": "<h1>Ex-Ante Revelation Principle Interface</h1>\n<p>Given an indirect Bayesian mechanism with transfers and an ex-ante Bayesian\nNash equilibrium strategy profile, the direct-revelation mechanism induced by\nthat profile satisfies the ex-ante revelation-principle conclusion.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, thm:md_ex_ante_revelation_interface] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
